{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fSUHgHDJow1794389510.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>據報德國軍方基於安全考慮，禁止在軍營和訓練場使用中國商用無人機。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.GER.DRONE-1100.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261sw4MEITiD1794366523.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>德國《明鏡周刊》報道，軍方近幾星期下達命令，立即停用所有中國無人機，包括無人機大廠、大疆生產的幾款機型，擔心無人機會將敏感資料，包括演習情況、軍營環境，甚至武器系統，傳送給中方情報部門。德國國防部證實有關措施，但拒絕透露採購了多少中國無人機。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.GER.DRONE-1100_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026uZouUDeeXn1794366554.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>除了無人機，報道指德國軍方亦以安全為由，對出入軍營和其他軍方設施的中國製車輛實施嚴格限制，包括比亞迪、吉利、蔚來的車不能再進入受管制區域。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T09:56:10.400867+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":224,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T02:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T13:12:02.998001+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T09:49:23.952998+00:00","content_hash":"2a3ce1ecf0e17b52a3fc709d427810a9ce9b63aec9aae716df20e0b5768cfcd1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T09:56:10.400867+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}